    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>We&#39;re happy to announce support for Azure Functions dynamic compute in the South India region. This is&nbsp;a first for dynamic compute in middle Asia.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/blog/e28ed35e-7aca-4396-8c13-e76175e8588e.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img alt=\"FunctionsIndia\" src=\"https://azurecomcdn.azureedge.net/mediahandler/acomblog/updates/ServiceUpdates/blog/5624e9cd-1001-484d-8e90-0c57598164fc.jpg\" title=\"FunctionsIndia\"></a></p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "We're happy to announce support for Azure Functions dynamic compute in the South India region. This is a first for dynamic compute in middle Asia."
  },
